### School Management System — API test file
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client) or
### JetBrains' built-in HTTP client. Run requests top-to-bottom — the login
### request captures the access token into a variable that later requests
### reuse automatically.
###
### Prereqs:
###   python manage.py runserver
###   python manage.py seed_data     (so students/teachers/exams exist)

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@contentType = application/json

### ===========================================================
### 0. AUTH
### ===========================================================

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/token/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin12345"
}

###

@accessToken = {{login.response.body.$.access}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.$.refresh}}

### Refresh the access token when it expires (8h lifetime by default)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/token/refresh/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refresh": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Login as a seeded teacher instead (any of teacher001..teacher100)
# @name loginTeacher
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/token/
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "teacher001",
  "password": "teacher12345"
}

###

@teacherToken = {{loginTeacher.response.body.$.access}}


### ===========================================================
### 1. HOMEPAGE & PUBLIC NOTICES (no auth required)
### ===========================================================

### Public Bangla notice board (HTML)
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Public notices feed (JSON, unauthenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/notices/


### ===========================================================
### 2. USERS / ACCOUNTS  (admin/headteacher write, everyone read)
### ===========================================================

### List users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Retrieve a single user (replace 1 with a real id from the list above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create a new staff account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "newstaff01",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!",
  "first_name": "Nusrat",
  "last_name": "Jahan",
  "email": "newstaff01@school.edu.bd",
  "phone": "01711000000",
  "role": "STAFF",
  "gender": "F"
}


### ===========================================================
### 3. ACADEMIC STRUCTURE  (read: everyone, write: admin/headteacher)
### ===========================================================

### Academic years
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/academic-years/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Classes (Form 6-10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/classes/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Groups (Science / Commerce / Arts / General)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Sections — filter by class/group, e.g. all Class 9 Science sections
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sections/?school_class=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Subjects — full NCTB list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/subjects/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Subjects filtered by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/subjects/?category=SCIENCE
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ===========================================================
### 4. TEACHERS
### ===========================================================

### List teachers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/teachers/?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Search teachers by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/teachers/?search=Rahman
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Retrieve one teacher (replace 1 with a real id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/teachers/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update a teacher's designation/qualification (admin/headteacher only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/teachers/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "education_qualification": "M.Sc in Physics, B.Ed"
}


### ===========================================================
### 5. STUDENTS  (role-scoped — see README section 3)
### ===========================================================

### List students (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students/?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Filter: all active Class 9 Science students
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students/?section__school_class=4&section__group=1&status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Search students by name / registration / guardian name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students/?search=Rahman
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Full detail for one student — replace 201 with a real id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students/201/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update a student (admin/headteacher, or that student's class teacher only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/students/201/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "previous_school": "Updated Previous School Name"
}

### Same request as a subject teacher (should be 403 outside their own class-teacher section)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students/201/
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### Create a new student (admin/headteacher)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/students/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "first_name": "Arifa",
  "last_name": "Islam",
  "gender": "F",
  "date_of_birth": "2012-04-15",
  "religion": "ISLAM",
  "section": 1,
  "roll_no": 999,
  "registration_no": "2026999999",
  "admission_date": "2026-01-10",
  "father_name": "Kamal Islam",
  "father_phone": "01711111111",
  "mother_name": "Rehana Islam",
  "mother_phone": "01722222222",
  "guardian_relation": "FATHER",
  "guardian_name": "Kamal Islam",
  "guardian_phone": "01711111111"
}


### ===========================================================
### 6. EXAMS, MARKS & GPA
### ===========================================================

### List exams
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/exams/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Mark entries for a specific student
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mark-entries/?student=3537
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Enter/update a mark for a student+subject+exam (admin/headteacher, or the assigned subject teacher)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mark-entries/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "exam": 1,
  "student": 3537,
  "subject": 1,
  "cq_obtained": 65,
  "mcq_obtained": 28,
  "practical_obtained": 0
}

### Recompute a student's GPA/result for an exam after marks change
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mark-entries/recompute/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "student": 3537,
  "exam": 1
}

### Exam results (GPA) for a student
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/exam-results/?student=3537
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ===========================================================
### 7. BILLING  (write: admin/headteacher only)
### ===========================================================

### Fee categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fee-categories/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Bills for a student
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bills/?student=3537
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Unpaid bills across the school
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bills/?status=UNPAID
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Record a payment against a bill (replace 1 with a real bill id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "bill": 1,
  "amount": 500,
  "method": "BKASH",
  "paid_on": "2026-09-26",
  "note": "Paid via bKash"
}


### ===========================================================
### 8. NOTICES  (Bangla unicode homepage board)
### ===========================================================

### List notices (auth'd)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notices/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Publish a new Bangla notice (admin/headteacher)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notices/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "শিক্ষক অভিভাবক সমাবেশ",
  "body": "আগামী ৫ অক্টোবর ২০২৬ তারিখে শিক্ষক-অভিভাবক সমাবেশ অনুষ্ঠিত হবে। সকল অভিভাবককে উপস্থিত থাকার জন্য অনুরোধ করা হলো।",
  "category": "GENERAL",
  "is_published": true,
  "pin_to_top": false
}


### ===========================================================
### 9. TEACHER COMMENTS
### ===========================================================

### Comments on a student
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/?student=3537
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Add a comment as a teacher (comment is attributed to the logged-in teacher)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "student": 3537,
  "comment": "Good improvement in class tests this term.",
  "visibility": "INTERNAL"
}


### ===========================================================
### 10. CARD GENERATION (PDF — open the response in a PDF viewer)
### ===========================================================

### Student ID Card
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cards/id/201/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Registration Card
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cards/registration/201/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admit Card (student must be Class 9/10 with an exam in that class)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cards/admit/3537/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
